tasks.note:
'put on' = kiymoq (ajraluvchi frazali fe'l).
'put this on' va 'put on this' — ikkalasi ham to'g'ri;
lekin olmosh bilan faqat 'put IT on'.

tasks.whyUz:
1-epizodda (24-bet) 'ON THE TRAIN...' sahnasi bor;
2-epizodda esa 'AT THE TRAIN STATION...' — demak POYEZDDA.
Transport: BY train (artiklsiz).
